    "detailed_description": "Suitable for all ages,<br />\r\nThe typical monopoly game for the whole family.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1-5 people can play on the same computer. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game uses the most classic real estate monopoly type of play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLet your characters move on the map by throwing dice.<br />\r\nYou may encounter fate, opportunity, or land that you can buy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuy the land and build a higher building each time you pass.<br />\r\nWhen someone enters your land, you can charge a large fee crossing !!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe ultimate goal is to make all other characters go bankrupt and become real estate monopoly!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn addition to the land, there are still many fate events!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe characters are cute, the real estate is exquisite, and the rules are easy to understand!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhether it is parent-child, friend, classmate, family.<br />\r\nGive you the most classic happy hour.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJust the price of a cup of milk tea!",
